Calc: export the chart model's placement mode

Chart export unconditionally wrote twoCellAnchor editAs="oneCell".
That changed page-fixed and resize-with-cell charts into move-only charts.
Select the mode from ScDrawLayer::GetAnchorType instead of a constant.
Keep the existing from/to geometry and use the actual edited model.

The regression covers all three placement modes through six input forms,
including omitted editAs and twoCellAnchor overrides. It checks both the
flat-ODF model and the saved workbook before and after reopening.
A rebuilt engine is still required for execution of this C++ change.

